  "summary": "Container\nContainer freight rates were a mixture of fortunes in the past week. The FBX Weighted Average decreased by 32 points from 3,419 at the end of last week, ending the week at 3,387. The main trade lane from Asia into the US West Coast (FBX01) saw rates easing off by USD 236, from USD7,643 at the end of last week, ending this week at USD7,407/FEU.",
